  "notes": ["The call census counts indexed direct sites, not live events. The nonliteral site is the type-41 wrapper; signed minus-one selectors deliberately skip a return.","Type-41 allocation refusal reads its table selector directly; the initializer copies it to carrier +0x158 for the later retirement leaf. Neither path is executed here.","Exact archived normal stocks are loaded by original installer and startup code. Owner callback tests declare a depleted inlet via a separate debit, with a clock sentinel.","Thunder Wire replays the original release with a declared event byte. Stock, object, descriptor, shape, stage-bounds and owner-identity controls are separate.","The one active stage-bounds visit suppresses audible playback via an already-held request. Pose and stage are supplied; the armed tether, contact routing, full scheduling and native gameplay are not qualified."],
